    "note": "Not stated in the class rules, which give dimensions (G.3.4: leech 6815 mm max; quarter, half, three-quarter and top widths 2320, 1690, 985 and 145 mm max). From those with a luff of about 6.33 m between the mast bands (F.3.6) and a foot of 2.743 m, an ORC-style estimate is about 9.85 m2 (E). Main + jib from the rules is then about 15.5 m2, nearer the 15.8 m2 secondary figure (C6) than 16.5"
